# Screenshot Placeholder

This is a placeholder for the web interface screenshot.

To add the actual screenshot:
1. Save your screenshot as "screenshot.png" in this directory
2. Replace this file with the actual image
3. Run: git add screenshot.png
4. Run: git commit -m "add web interface screenshot"
5. Run: git push

The screenshot should show the Ethereum Fraud Detection System web interface at http://localhost:8081/
